  "notes": "MiroTalk dark UI: near-black #121215 stage with subtle radial gradient tiles, 10px rounded corners everywhere. Tiles show coloured initial circles (teal DA, rust TO, sage LU) or a cartoon avatar when video is off; tile toolbar has small square icon buttons with red camera/mic-off glyphs and a yellow raised-hand icon. Bottom bar uses 50px square icon buttons with chevron split-buttons and a red leave button; disabled mic/cam tinted dark red with yellow '!' badges. Polls window is modeless, centred and resizable (corner grip). Poll options are radio rows whose background fill shows vote share, with 'NN% (n)' at right and voter names below for non-anonymous polls. No codebook entry for polls; filed new-entry 'poll'."
